id: vehicle-extra-space
name: Extra Space
kind: vehicle quality
slots: 1~3
source: Vehicles
extraRows: slots
# Its entry as the Vehicles page prints it, word for word.
text: >
  Extra Space: Someone has extended this Vehicle in length to accommodate more passengers.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1~3
  –Effects: For every Quality Slot, increase the amount of Squares occupied by this Vehicle by applying an additional
  row at the bottom of the Squares occupied by this Vehicle due to its Size Category.

---
